==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*6 [[Prof. Owlbrowley]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*7 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Prof. Owlbrowley]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This level probably would've been hard, but [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Soba Cat]] one-shots Super Metal Hippoe at level 44, drastically reducing the difficulty of this level. The name of the game here is being able to consistantly get Soba hits onto the Super Metal Hippoes as things get more chaotic over time. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] is great here to block Diabrollow's knockback Mini-Waves, while [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]] is a good option to stall everything at the front.

The basic strategy is to just use [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] to kill the Diabrollows quickly, allowing Soba Cat to quickly Crit the Super Metal Hippoes.

